  "design": "* Two-stage Miller OTA, SkyWater SKY130 1.8 V MOS devices, VDD = 1.8 V\n* Pins: inp inn out vdd vss ibias. Bias: a 10 uA current flows into ibias.\n* Stage 1: NMOS differential pair XM1/XM2, PMOS mirror load XM3/XM4, tail source XM5.\n* Stage 2: PMOS common source XM6, NMOS current sink XM7. Miller compensation Cc with zero resistor Rz.\n* W and L are in um (the SKY130 model library sets \".option scale=1e-6\").\n.subckt ota inp inn out vdd vss ibias\nXM8 ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=1 nf=1\nXM5 tail ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=4 l=1 nf=1\nXM1 x inn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.5 nf=2\nXM2 y inp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.5 nf=2\nXM3 x x vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=12 l=0.5 nf=2\nXM4 y x vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=12 l=0.5 nf=2\nXM6 out y vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=48 l=0.5 nf=6\nXM7 out ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=8 l=1 nf=2\nRz y z 5k\nCc z out 1p\n.ends ota\n",
